The goal of this improvement is to add the current Group selector on the Activities Overview Page to allow teachers and students to filter by groups

*Screenshot:*

!Screenshot 2025-06-06 at 12.25.39.png!

_*Example of user story:*_
{quote}{{As a Teacher}}

{{I want to filter the activities on a specific group}}

{{In order to review the pending task that requires my attention in a specific group.}}
{quote}
 

*Notice:* This issue may affect the existing integrations on the project. So, we will need some new issues once we know which integrated activities will be affected by this.

This was fixed in MDL-74814 for {{{}selectgroups{}}}, but this is still a problem for {{{}select{}}}, {{{}tags{}}}, and {{autocomplete}} - possibly others.

The necessary change is to add this to {{export_for_template}} in the {{MoodleQuickForm_select}} class.
{code:java}$context['staticlabel'] = $this->_flagFrozen;{code}
